# x-algorithm-studio

- On a **new chat**, follow `agent/SESSION_PROTOCOL.md` first (Welcome → … → CTAs).
- Credit owner from `OWNER.md`.
- Product language is **English only**.
- After the user picks Questions / Demo / Build, use `docs/agent-loop.md` for depth.
- Prefer `make demo-fixture` / `make agent-smoke` before claiming ranking output.
- Never claim live production X ranking or invent production weights as fact.
- Do not casually edit `vendor/x-algorithm/`; extend under `extensions/` and `presets/`.
- Teach mechanism literacy, not spam growth hacks.
- After scoring changes, run `make explain` when `results.json` exists.
